---
// Segment router: the three audiences this site serves arrive with different
// questions (briefings/impact-playbook/AUDIENCES.md in the clawd repo).
// Residents want help and their ward facts. Journalists want checkable figures
// fast. Data readers want the numbers. One card each, first screenful.
---

<section class="audience-paths" aria-label="Start here">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="paths-grid">
      <div class="path-card">
        <div class="path-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="path-title">Live in Padiham or Burnley?</h3>
        <p class="path-desc">Raise a problem, get help with a council issue, or see what is being spent in your ward.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="path-link">Contact Tom</a>
        <span class="path-secondary">
          Get the <a href="/updates/">weekly update</a> on the area, or
          <a href="https://www.gov.uk/apply-postal-vote" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">set up a postal vote</a> in about five minutes.
        </span>
      </div>

      <a href="/press/" class="path-card">
        <div class="path-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="path-title">Reporting on Lancashire?</h3>
        <p class="path-desc">Every figure published here traces to a document you can check. Method, data and contact routes for journalists.</p>
        <span class="path-link">Press and researchers</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/projects/" class="path-card">
        <div class="path-icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="path-title">Want the numbers?</h3>
        <p class="path-desc">Council spending, population, elections and asylum data. Four open sites, every figure traced to its source.</p>
        <span class="path-link">See the projects</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .audience-paths {
    padding: var(--space-lg) 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  .paths-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .path-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) 0;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .path-card + .path-card {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .path-card:hover {
    color: inherit;
  }

  .path-card:hover .path-title {
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .path-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .path-title {
    font-size: 1.3125rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .path-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .path-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: var(--touch);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--teal);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  }

  .path-secondary {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .paths-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .path-card,
    .path-card + .path-card {
      padding: var(--space-md) 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .path-card + .path-card {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
  }
</style>
